# ==========================================================================
# cheCkOVER — files that must NOT be published
# ==========================================================================
# This repository is PUBLIC. Everything below is excluded deliberately; read
# the reason before removing any line.

# --- Credentials -----------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit keys. A key pushed to a public repo is compromised immediately
# and must be rotated, not just deleted.
*.ppk
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
.Renviron
.env

# --- Raw occurrence data ---------------------------------------------------
# The WoC exports carry exact coordinates for records flagged confidential
# (confidentialityLevel 1 and 2 — 69,040 of 124,328 in the 2026-07 export).
# cheCkOVER's own export module strips longitude/latitude/confidentiality from
# published packages precisely so those localities are not disclosed; committing
# the raw export would defeat that. Obtain the data from World of Crayfish under
# its access terms instead.
WoC_*.tsv
database-WoC*.tsv
*_occurrences*.tsv
*_occurrences*.csv
clean_occurrences*
# ...but the canonical geographic vocabulary is a small lookup table the
# pipeline needs, not occurrence data. Keep it.
!WoC_canonical_country_continent.tsv

# --- Unreferenced binaries -------------------------------------------------
# Not read by any module; keeping them out avoids shipping blobs of unclear
# provenance. RollData.tsv is NOT listed: despite the misleading extension it is
# an Excel workbook, but it is already published in this repository, so removing
# it is a deliberate decision for the maintainers rather than a .gitignore side
# effect.
#   README.docx         - superseded by README.md
#   vernacular_*.docx   - legacy; the pipeline reads the .tsv
README.docx
vernacular_names_wide.docx

# --- Third-party reference layers -----------------------------------------
# ~2.5 GB, and redistribution is governed by each provider's licence
# (HydroBASINS/HydroSHEDS, WWF FEOW/TEOW, UNEP-WCMC WDPA, GADM, Natural Earth).
# Download them yourself — see README "Reference data".
spatial_data/
*.shp
*.shx
*.dbf
*.sbn
*.sbx
*.prj
*.cpg

# NB: Table_S3.tsv (HydroBASINS name lookup, 39 MB) and Table_S5.tsv are NOT
# ignored — they are supplementary tables already published in this repository
# and cited by the accompanying manuscript. Excluding them would delete them.

# --- Generated output ------------------------------------------------------
# Reproducible by running the pipeline; large and churny.
checkover_output/
*.rar
*.zip

# --- Manuscript ------------------------------------------------------------
# Kept out of the code repo; lives with the journal submission.
manuscript/
checkover_handover_*/

# --- R / RStudio -----------------------------------------------------------
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj.user

# --- Editors / OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Agent scratch ---------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
